{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32363","headline":"寒食前有怀 · 温庭筠","name":"寒食前有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万物鲜华雨乍晴，春寒寂历近清明。\n残芳荏苒双飞蝶，晓睡朦胧百啭莺。\n旧侣不归成独酌，故园虽在有谁耕。\n悠然更起严滩恨，一宿东风蕙草生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}